    <string name="fonts_help_title">Help: importing fonts</string>
    <string name="fonts_help_text">Files: choose one or more .ttf or .otf files from this device, a USB drive or a cloud drive (Drive, OneDrive…).\n\nZIP: a .zip installs every valid font it contains at once; folders inside the ZIP are fine. Files that are not fonts are ignored.\n\nChecks: each font is validated. Fonts you already have (or that come with the app) are skipped as duplicates; damaged or unsupported files are not installed. A summary shows what was installed, skipped, invalid or failed.\n\nLimits: up to 25 MB per font and 400 MB per unpacked ZIP; the import stops if the storage runs low.\n\nManaging: tap a font to use it; tap the star to keep it in Favourites; touch and hold a font you imported to delete it from this device (projects that use it keep their own copy). Fonts that come with the app cannot be deleted.\n\nLicences: import only fonts you are allowed to use.</string>
